<title>USA: Warwick, R.I. won by State Street.</title>
<headline>Warwick, R.I. won by State Street.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Bank &amp; Trust Co. said it won $4.685 million of Warwick, R.I., general obligation refunding bonds, 1997 Series B, with a true interest cost of 4.66 percent.</p>
</text>
